 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "Applying for a public service",
   "s": 0.22,
   "e": 1.82,
   "part": "a"
  },
  {
   "text": "still means starting from zero.",
   "s": 1.82,
   "e": 3.769,
   "part": "a"
  },
  {
   "text": "Three portals. Three accounts.",
   "s": 3.769,
   "e": 5.609,
   "part": "a"
  },
  {
   "text": "The same identity, address, and income,",
   "s": 5.609,
   "e": 7.929,
   "part": "a"
  },
  {
   "text": "typed in again every time.",
   "s": 7.929,
   "e": 9.9,
   "part": "a"
  },
  {
   "text": "In the final month of the Medicaid unwinding,",
   "s": 9.92,
   "e": 12.32,
   "part": "a"
  },
  {
   "text": "about 2 in 3 people who lost coverage lost it for paperwork reasons.",
   "s": 12.32,
   "e": 16.801,
   "part": "a"
  },
  {
   "text": "Finance got a connection layer.",
   "s": 16.871,
   "e": 18.631,
   "part": "a"
  },
  {
   "text": "Government services never did.",
   "s": 18.631,
   "e": 20.471,
   "part": "a"
  },
  {
   "text": "DigiPae is building it. Think Plaid, but for government.",
   "s": 20.471,
   "e": 24.027,
   "part": "a"
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the app, today.",
   "s": 24.173,
   "e": 25.827,
   "part": "b"
  },
  {
   "text": "Sign in with just your phone number.",
   "s": 25.907,
   "e": 28.192,
   "part": "b"
  },
  {
   "text": "A one-time code confirms it's really you.",
   "s": 28.54,
   "e": 31.121,
   "part": "b"
  },
  {
   "text": "Before anything happens, you see exactly what you're agreeing to.",
   "s": 31.207,
   "e": 34.782,
   "part": "b"
  },
  {
   "text": "Then you lock it with your own PIN.",
   "s": 34.84,
   "e": 36.893,
   "part": "b"
  },
  {
   "text": "Your home screen holds your digital ID,",
   "s": 37.74,
   "e": 39.82,
   "part": "b"
  },
  {
   "text": "ready to verify.",
   "s": 39.82,
   "e": 41.374,
   "part": "b"
  },
  {
   "text": "Documents are organized by category.",
   "s": 41.44,
   "e": 44.026,
   "part": "b"
  },
  {
   "text": "Government IDs alone covers licenses,",
   "s": 44.107,
   "e": 46.587,
   "part": "b"
  },
  {
   "text": "passports, green cards, work permits, and more.",
   "s": 46.587,
   "e": 49.788,
   "part": "b"
  },
  {
   "text": "Pulling a license straight from the issuer is coming soon.",
   "s": 49.873,
   "e": 52.993,
   "part": "b"
  },
  {
   "text": "For now, you upload a copy to your vault.",
   "s": 52.993,
   "e": 55.517,
   "part": "b"
  },
  {
   "text": "Consent first. Only where access is permitted.",
   "s": 55.573,
   "e": 58.538,
   "part": "b"
  },
  {
   "text": "One consent-based connection",
